# chatgpt-land
enter the world of chatgpt land!



this demo version works by sending in chatgpt, the real full version will have a bot that im pretty sure works in it to!

what to do to activate your game demo 

1: find the game, right click it then press rename

2: rename the demo to - chatgpt land DEMO.html

3: right click the file again then press open as

4: click a browser then open it, it might open instantly, if not then double click the file

bye!








